  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">My next webinar is on vitamin K. It’s been touted for bone, brain, and heart health, but have vitamin K supplements been shown to help? To complicate matters, there are multiple types of vitamin K: Vitamin K1 is concentrated in greens, and a type of vitamin K2 is found in animal products. Do we need both? Do we have to rely on a healthy microbiome for conversion from one to the other? Do we have to eat a slimy, fermented food called natto? </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Join me for a 60-minute live webinar on October 7 at 2pm ET to learn everything you ever wanted to know about vitamin K.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Key Takeaways: Saturated Fat </b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/saturated-fat/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-89443\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1.jpg 1000w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/butter-3411126-1280-1-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Saturated fat—the kind of fat that is solid at room temperature—is found mostly in animal products like fatty meats and dairy. We’ve known for a long time that saturated fat raises cholesterol, contributing to our number one killer, heart disease. It also impacts insulin resistance and can lead to other diseases. Hold on. I said it’s mostly found in animal products, but what about that jar of coconut oil in your cabinet that’s also solid at room temperature? Saturated fat. See what I have to say on the matter of both animal- and plant-derived saturated fats on the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/saturated-fat/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Recipe: Veggie Mac &amp; Cheese</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/veggie-mac-cheese/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-89449 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/mac-and-cheese2-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Dairy is the number one source of saturated fat in the United States, but, fortunately, there are many ways to make plant-based versions of traditionally dairy-laden dishes. A cruciferous spin on macaroni and cheese, this recipe takes comfort food to a whole new level and is a tasty way to check off a few servings on the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Dozen checklist</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. This recipe comes from Kristina, our director of Nutrition &amp; Social Media Strategy. Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/veggie-mac-cheese/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and watch a video on how it’s made on our </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ca2UQU5AyoU/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b><i>Evidence-Based Eating Guide</i></b><b> Now in Spanish</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-89445 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/eg-1.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>I’m thrilled to announce that our popular </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evidence-Based Eating Guide </span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">is now available in two new languages. This resource includes information on my Traffic Light eating system, the Daily Dozen, sample menus, and more. Read about it and download a digital copy </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/healthkit/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. You can also order hard copies in </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/healthkit\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">English</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/evidence-based-eating-guide-es\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spanish</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for only the cost of printing and shipping. Help us continue creating these fun and useful resources by making a donation today!</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>NutritionFacts.org Around the World</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-89451\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/subtitles-sq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/subtitles-sq.jpg 718w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/subtitles-sq-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/09/subtitles-sq-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>Did you know that every NutritionFacts video has subtitles in English and a variety of other languages, prepared by our volunteers?</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fR3DVTSNi58\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Learn how to access them</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and other playback settings. Also,</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/translations-info/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">see important information</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> about our translated resources.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Top Three Videos</b></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-87997\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"homemade kimchi in jars in a bright white kitchen\" width=\"216\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/58-22-the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 216px) 100vw, 216px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-role-of-kimchi-and-h-pylori-in-stomach-cancer/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Role of Kimchi and </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">H. pylori</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in Stomach Cancer</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">  </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What explains the Achilles’ heel in certain Asian diets?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-87431\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"doctor measuring blood pressure and pulse with clip board\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-19-why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-dont-health-insurers-encourage-healthier-eating/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Don’t Health Insurers Encourage Healthier Eating?</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why don’t more big payors in health care embrace plant-based eating?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-88133\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Blue illustration of circulatory system\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/07/59-02-the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-treating-atrial-fibrillation/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Best Diet for Treating Atrial Fibrillation</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What foods should we eat and avoid to reduce our risk of Afib?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Live Q&amp;A October 6 </b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68737 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"image of dr greger\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/09/Live.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>Every month, I do a live Q&amp;A right from my treadmill, and the next one is October 6!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At 3 pm ET, tune in on our </span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facebook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> page, </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> channel, or (new!) directly on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NutritionFacts.org</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can find links to past live Q&amp;As </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember, I have an </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">audio podcast</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to keep you company, too. </span></p>"
